Package: ohseer
Title: Multi-Provider OCR API Interface for R
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-16
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nathan", "Layman", , "n8.layman@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2238-6584")))
Description: Provides interfaces to multiple OCR and document parsing APIs including
    Claude Opus 4.5 (#1 on OCR Arena), Mistral OCR 3, AWS Textract, and Tensorlake
    for document processing in R. Supports text extraction, table detection, form
    parsing, and structured data extraction. All providers return compatible output
    formats for seamless integration.
